ax-mobile:text-eyebrow-mobile max-mobile:tracking-[.06em] flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>Request a quote</p> <h1 class="mb-4 max-w-[720px] text-[clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3rem)] font-black leading-[1.12] tracking-[-.035em]">Get a cleaning quote.</h1> <p class="max-w-[700px] text-lede mt-4">Tell us what needs cleaning and your preferred dates. We’ll follow up by phone or email to discuss the details. We’ll confirm the price and available dates with you before booking.</p> <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-small"> <span>Prefer to talk it through?</span> <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-sea-dark underline" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-sea-dark underline" href="sms:+13213239776">Text us</a> </div> <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[.86rem] font-[750] text-sea-dark" aria-label="Quote assurances"> <span><span aria-hidden="true">✓ </span>Local &amp; owner-operated</span><span><span aria-hidden="true">✓ </span>Clear scope and price before booking</span><span><span aria-hidden="true">✓ </span>Call or text us directly</span> </div> <form class="quote-form mt-7 grid max-w-[600px] gap-5" action="https://formspree.io/f/xzzenlyg" method="POST" data-submitting-button="Sending..." data-submitting-status="Sending your quote request..."> <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://beachlinecleaners.com/quote-success/"> <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Beachline Cleaners Quote Request"> <div class="hidden" aria-hidden="true"> <label>Don’t fill this out if you&#39;re human:</label> <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"> </div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="name">Your Name</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="First and last name"> </div> <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-[601px]:grid-cols-1"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="phone">Phone Number</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="(321) 555-0123" pattern="(?=(?:[^0-9]*[0-9]){10,15}[^0-9]*$)\+?[0-9 .\(\)\-]+" title="Enter 10–15 digits. Spaces, parentheses, dots, hyphens, and a leading + are allowed."> </div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="email">Email Address (Optional)</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@example.com"> </div> </div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="location">Town, ZIP Code, or Property Address</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="location" name="location" required placeholder="e.g. 32922 or Cocoa Beach"> </div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="service">Service Type</label> <select class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" id="service" name="service" required> <option value="">Select a service...</option> <option value="residential">Home Cleaning</option><option value="commercial">Commercial Cleaning</option><option value="deep">Deep Cleaning</option><option value="move">Move-in / Move-out</option><option value="vacation">Vacation Rental</option><option value="other">Other</option> </select> </div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="size">Approximate Size (sq ft) (Optional)</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="size" name="size" placeholder="e.g. 1800"> </div> <noscript><p>Use the fields for your service below and leave the others blank. Empty cabinet interiors are included with move cleaning.</p></noscript> <fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-service-fields="residential,deep,move,vacation"> <legend class="mb-3 text-label font-bold">Home or rental details (optional)</legend> <div class="grid gap-4"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="beds_baths">Bedrooms / Bathrooms</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="beds_baths" name="beds_baths" placeholder="e.g. 3 bed, 2 bath"> </div> </div> </fieldset><fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-service-fields="deep"> <legend class="mb-3 text-label font-bold">Deep-clean details (optional)</legend> <div class="grid gap-4"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="cleaning_condition">Areas that need extra attention</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="cleaning_condition" name="cleaning_condition" placeholder="e.g. bathroom buildup, baseboards, kitchen grease"> </div> </div> </fieldset><fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-service-fields="move"> <legend class="mb-3 text-label font-bold">Move details (optional)</legend> <div class="grid gap-4"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="move_readiness">When will the property be empty?</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="move_readiness" name="move_readiness" placeholder="e.g. empty now, or movers leave October 15"> </div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="handoff_date">Inspection or handoff deadline</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="handoff_date" name="handoff_date" placeholder="e.g. October 17, before noon"> </div> </div> </fieldset><fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-service-fields="vacation"> <legend class="mb-3 text-label font-bold">Turnover timing (optional)</legend> <div class="grid gap-4"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="checkout_time">Guest checkout</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="checkout_time" name="checkout_time" placeholder="Date and time"> </div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="checkin_time">Next guest check-in</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="checkin_time" name="checkin_time" placeholder="Date and time"> </div> </div> </fieldset><fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-service-fields="commercial"> <legend class="mb-3 text-label font-bold">Workspace details (optional)</legend> <div class="grid gap-4"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="workspace_type">Type of workspace</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="workspace_type" name="workspace_type" placeholder="e.g. office, shop, professional suite"> </div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="restrooms_shared_areas">Restrooms and shared areas</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="restrooms_shared_areas" name="restrooms_shared_areas" placeholder="e.g. 2 restrooms, breakroom, reception"> </div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="cleaning_hours_access">Cleaning hours and access requirements</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="cleaning_hours_access" name="cleaning_hours_access" placeholder="e.g. after 6 pm, front-desk check-in; no access codes"> </div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label" for="commercial_priorities">Cleaning priorities or checklist</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="commercial_priorities" name="commercial_priorities" placeholder="e.g. floors, restrooms, desks; any areas to leave alone"> </div> </div> </fieldset> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="frequency">Preferred Date / Cleaning Frequency (Optional)</label> <input class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" type="text" id="frequency" name="frequency" placeholder="e.g. October 15, one-time or biweekly"> </div> <fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-service-fields="residential,deep,move" aria-describedby="home-extras-hint"> <legend class="text-label font-bold">Optional extras for home, deep &amp; move cleaning</legend> <p id="home-extras-hint" class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Just need the standard service? Leave these unchecked. Selected extras are quoted separately.</p> <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 max-mobile:grid-cols-1"> <label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 py-2 text-label" for="extra_oven" data-service-option="residential,deep,move"> <input class="size-5 shrink-0 accent-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-offset-2" type="checkbox" id="extra_oven" name="extra_oven" value="Inside oven"> <span>Inside oven</span> </label><label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 py-2 text-label" for="extra_fridge" data-service-option="residential,deep,move"> <input class="size-5 shrink-0 accent-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-offset-2" type="checkbox" id="extra_fridge" name="extra_fridge" value="Inside refrigerator"> <span>Inside refrigerator</span> </label><label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 py-2 text-label" for="extra_cabinets" data-service-option="residential,deep"> <input class="size-5 shrink-0 accent-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-offset-2" type="checkbox" id="extra_cabinets" name="extra_cabinets" value="Inside cabinets (empty; included with move cleaning)"> <span>Inside cabinets (empty; included with move cleaning)</span> </label><label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 py-2 text-label" for="extra_windows" data-service-option="residential,deep,move"> <input class="size-5 shrink-0 accent-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-offset-2" type="checkbox" id="extra_windows" name="extra_windows" value="Interior windows"> <span>Interior windows</span> </label> </div> </fieldset><fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-service-fields="vacation" aria-describedby="rental-extras-hint"> <legend class="text-label font-bold">Optional vacation-rental extras</legend> <p id="rental-extras-hint" class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Beds are reset with provided clean linens. Laundry and supply restocking are quoted separately by arrangement.</p> <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 max-mobile:grid-cols-1"> <label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 py-2 text-label" for="extra_laundry" data-service-option="vacation"> <input class="size-5 shrink-0 accent-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-offset-2" type="checkbox" id="extra_laundry" name="extra_laundry" value="Laundry"> <span>Laundry</span> </label><label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 py-2 text-label" for="extra_restocking" data-service-option="vacation"> <input class="size-5 shrink-0 accent-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-sea-dark focus-visible:outline-offset-2" type="checkbox" id="extra_restocking" name="extra_restocking" value="Supply restocking"> <span>Supply restocking</span> </label> </div> </fieldset> <details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50 form-details-toggle mt-1"> <summary class="inline-flex list-none items-center gap-1.5 text-compact-action font-bold text-sea-dark">Add more details (optional)</summary> <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"> <label class="text-label font-bold" for="notes">Additional Notes (Optional)</label> <textarea class="min-w-0 w-full rounded-lg border border-field-line bg-field px-4 py-3 text-base text-ink placeholder:text-ink-soft transition-[border-color,outline] hover:border-ink-soft focus:border-sea-dark focus:outline-3 focus:outline-sea-dark focus:outline-offset-1 aria-invalid:border-danger aria-invalid:focus:outline-danger" id="notes" name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Priorities, buildup, or extras. For rentals, include checkout/check-in times and laundry or restocking needs. Please do not include door codes."></textarea> </div> </div> </details> <p id="quote-privacy" class="text-sm text-ink-soft">This form sends your contact and property details to Beachline Cleaners through Formspree to handle your quote request. Do not include door codes, payment details, or other sensitive information.</p> <button type="submit" aria-describedby="quote-privacy" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold submit-btn mt-2.5 w-full">Send Quote Request<svg class="shrink-0 size-[18px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>   </svg></button> <p class="submission-status text-sm text-ink-soft" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p> </form> </div> <aside class="sticky top-[110px] border-y border-line bg-white/70 px-6 py-7 max-tablet:hidden"> <h3 class="mb-3">Prefer to call or text?</h3> <p class="mb-5 mt-4">Need cleaning by a specific date? Call or text us to discuss availability before making plans.</p> <div class="grid gap-2.5"> <a href="tel:+13213239776" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-sea/30 active:bg-line/30 min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold w-full">Call (321) 323-9776</a> <a href="sms:+13213239776" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-sea/30 active:bg-line/30 min-h-[46px] px-control-x text-compact-action font-[750]">Text (321) 323-9776</a> </div> <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 text-[1.1rem]">A few details to have ready</h3> <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 text-small text-ink-soft"> <li>Your address or ZIP code</li><li>Property size and layout</li><li>Service type and priorities</li><li>Preferred dates or frequency</li> </ul> </aside> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class="footer bg-footer pt-7 pb-5 text-white group-[.island-home]/site:bg-footer max-mobile:pt-6 max-mobile:pb