derline hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href="/deep-cleaning/">Deep Cleaning</a><a class="w-fit min-h-11 flex items-center py-1 no-underline hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href="/move-out-cleaning/">Move-In / Move-Out</a> </div> </div> <div> <strong>Company</strong> <div class="mt-3 grid gap-0.5 text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text"> <a class="w-fit min-h-11 flex items-center py-1 no-underline hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href="/about/">About</a><a class="w-fit min-h-11 flex items-center py-1 no-underline hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href="/service-area/">Service Area</a><a class="w-fit min-h-11 flex items-center py-1 no-underline hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href="/faq/">FAQ</a><a class="w-fit min-h-11 flex items-center py-1 no-underline hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href="/quote/">Get a Quote</a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="mt-4 border-t border-white/20 pt-3 text-[.84rem] text-white/75">
